  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">農地法第 18 条第 6 項の規定による通知書</text:p>
      <text:p>大宜味村農業委員会会長　殿</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">令和　　年　　月　　日</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="Parties1" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/>
        <table:table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C7"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C8"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C9"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="3"><text:p>所有者<br/>(貸人)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>氏名</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="7"><text:p text:style-name="Center">印　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　○</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>住所</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="7"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>連絡先</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="7"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="3"><text:p>耕作者<br/>(借人)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>氏名</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="7"><text:p text:style-name="Center">印　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　○</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>住所</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="7"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>連絡先</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="7"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>下記の農地について貸借の解約をしたので、農地法第 18 条第 6 項の規定により通知します。</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">記</text:p>
      <text:p>１．土地の所在・地番・地目・面積及び利用権の内容</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="Land1" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C7"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C8"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C9"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p text:style-name="Center">土地</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="Center">利　　　用　　　権</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p>当事者の法律関係</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>大　字</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>小　字</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地　番</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地　目</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>面　積<br/>(　㎡)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>種　類</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>始　期</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>終　期</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="3"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>１．解約の理由　：　</text:p>
      <text:p>２．合意解約の合意が成立した日　　　　　　　　　　　　　令和　　年　　月　　日</text:p>
      <text:p>３．合意による解約をした日　　　　　　　　　　　　　　令和　　年　　月　　日</text:p>
      <text:p>４．土地の引渡の時期　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　令和　　年　　月　　日</text:p>
      <text:p>５．その他参考となるべき事項　：　無し</text:p>
      <text:p>※添付書類：合意解約書の写し、農地利用集積計画の写し</text:p>

      <text:p text:style-name="PageTitle">合意解約書</text:p>
      <text:p>下記表示の農地は　　　　　　　　の所有であり　　　　　　はこれを耕作目的で貸借し農地として供してきたが、この度合意により解約が成立しました。</text:p>
      <text:p>当事者間とも異議なく承諾し土地の引き渡しを行ない、この解約について紛争等は一切ありません。</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">記</text:p>
      <text:p>１．土地の所在・地番・地目・面積及び利用権の内容</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="Land2" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C7"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C8"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C9"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p text:style-name="Center">土地</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="Center">利　　　用　　　権</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p>当事者の法律関係</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>大　字</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>小　字</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地　番</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地　目</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>面　積<br/>(　㎡)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>種　類</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>始　期</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>終　期</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
